  "goodToKnow": "Die Bescheinigung is a certificate or written confirmation, a cornerstone of German bureaucracy: Meldebescheinigung (proof of registration), Immatrikulationsbescheinigung (proof of enrolment), Arbeitsunfähigkeitsbescheinigung (sick note, AU). Since 2023, doctors send sick notes to employers' health insurers electronically (the eAU). Bescheinigen means to certify. Plural: die Bescheinigungen."
